# Icon Directory
# Place generated icons here:
# - favicon.ico (multi-resolution ICO file)
# - favicon-16x16.png
# - favicon-32x32.png
# - apple-touch-icon.png (180x180)
# - icon-72x72.png
# - icon-96x96.png
# - icon-128x128.png
# - icon-144x144.png
# - icon-152x152.png
# - icon-192x192.png
# - icon-384x384.png
# - icon-512x512.png
# - icon.svg
# 
# Generate these from the favicon.svg using tools like:
# - https://realfavicongenerator.net/
# - https://favicon.io/
